<p>Strike the target with both weapons dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">115%, 130%, 141%, 151%, 160%</acronym> damage with each hit.  Each strike that hits will increase the duration of the lowest duration disease effect by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 3, 3.</acronym></p>